  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please wait while we connect you to an agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768859934000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Isaac. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768859942533333
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14231,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768859947133333
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. May I have your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768859949133333
    },
    {
      "text": "Jane Smith. Order 788-12554.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14231,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768859955066666
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Jane. I see the order here for the VeloFit Pro-Lite cycling shoes. To get started, could you tell me what specifically is the issue with them? Is it a technical fault or a matter of preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768859957133332
    },
    {
      "text": "They hurt my feet. I've got blisters. I just want a refund.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14231,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768859970933332
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear that. Discomfort is definitely not the experience we want for our customers. Just to be sure, were you able to properly position the cleats for your foot alignment?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768859975066665
    },
    {
      "text": "The cleats are fine. The shoes are not. I don't need a lesson, I need a return label.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14231,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768859987399998
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. My apologies. Let me just check the policy for you. I see the delivery was made 35 days ago. One moment.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768859993266664
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14231,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768860001133330
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, thank you for your patience. I've reviewed your order and our return policy. Since you are within the 90-day return window, I can absolutely process this return for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768860001933330
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. About time.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14231,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768860013799996
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just initiated the return. You'll receive an email with a prepaid shipping label and instructions within the next 15 minutes. Once we receive the cycling shoes back at our warehouse, your refund will be processed back to your original payment method. Is there anything else I can assist you with?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768860015133329
    },
    {
      "text": "No, I guess that's all.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
